msgid "Circular Descriptives"
msgstr "循环描述统计"

msgid "Valid"
msgstr "有效"

msgid "Missing"
msgstr "缺失"

msgid "Mean Direction"
msgstr "平均方向"

msgid "Mean Resultant Length"
msgstr "平均合向量长度"

msgid "Median"
msgstr "中位数"

msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "标准差"

msgid "Variance"
msgstr "方差"

msgid "Range"
msgstr "范围"

msgid "<em>Note.</em>"
msgstr "<em>注.</em>"

msgid "If not stated otherwise, all values are calculated on a normalized period of 2π."
msgstr "除非另有说明，所有值均在 2π 的正规化周期上计算。"

msgid "Value is shown with respect to the original period."
msgstr "该值相对于原始周期显示。"

msgid "Aaron Bahde and Philipp Berens (2019). University of Tuebingen."
msgstr "Aaron Bahde 与 Philipp Berens（2019）。图宾根大学。"

msgid "Ulric Lund and Claudio Agostinelli (2017). Circular (Version 0.4-93): Circular Statistics [R Package]."
msgstr "Ulric Lund 与 Claudio Agostinelli（2017）。Circular（版本 0.4-93）：循环统计 [R 软件包]。"

msgid "Circular Descriptives Plots"
msgstr "循环描述统计图"

msgid "The plotting depends on some of the calculations (e.g. the mean direction). But the calculations returned the following error: %s"
msgstr "绘图依赖某些计算（例如平均方向）。但计算返回了以下错误：%s"

msgid "The plotting for this set-up failed with: %s"
msgstr "此设置的绘图失败，错误为：%s"

msgid "The data of the dependent variable %1$s grouped on factor %2$s exceeds the tolerance for the concentration. The data shows almost zero variance. Did you maybe specify the wrong period?"
msgstr "按因子 %2$s 分组的因变量 %1$s 的数据超出了浓度的容差。数据显示方差几乎为零。您是否可能指定了错误的周期？"

msgid "Watson-Williams"
msgstr "Watson-Williams"

msgid "Watson-Wheeler"
msgstr "Watson-Wheeler"

msgid "One-way ANOVA"
msgstr "单因素方差分析"

msgid "Cases"
msgstr "个案"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "检验"

msgid "p"
msgstr "p"

msgid "F"
msgstr "F"

msgid "df1"
msgstr "df1"

msgid "df2"
msgstr "df2"

msgid "W"
msgstr "W"

msgid "df"
msgstr "df"

msgid "All statistics are calculated on a normalized period of 2%s."
msgstr "所有统计量均在 2%s 的正规化周期上计算。"

msgid "The degrees of freedom of the %1$s%2$s-distribution to which W is compared."
msgstr "W 与之比较的 %1$s%2$s 分布的自由度。"

msgid "<em>Warning.</em>"
msgstr "<em>警告.</em>"

msgid "Concentration parameters (%1$s) not equal between the groups of factor %2$s. The Watson-Williams test might not be applicable."
msgstr "因子 %2$s 的各组之间的浓度参数（%1$s）不相等。Watson-Williams 检验可能不适用。"

msgid "Some groups of factor %s contain less than 10 measurements. The Watson-Wheeler test might not be applicable."
msgstr "因子 %s 的一些组包含少于 10 个测量值。Watson-Wheeler 检验可能不适用。"

msgid "Two-way ANOVA (Harrison-Kanji Test)"
msgstr "双因素方差分析（Harrison-Kanji 检验）"

msgid "Sum of Square"
msgstr "平方和"

msgid "Mean Square"
msgstr "均方"

msgid "Estimated %1$s is %2$s (> 2). The respective routine was run."
msgstr "估计的 %1$s 为 %2$s（> 2）。已运行相应的程序。"

msgid "Estimated %1$s is %2$s (< 2). The respective routine was run."
msgstr "估计的 %1$s 为 %2$s（< 2）。已运行相应的程序。"

msgid "D. Harrison, G.K Kanji and R. J. Gadsden (2016). Analysis of Variance for Circular Data."
msgstr "D. Harrison、G.K Kanji 与 R. J. Gadsden（2016）。循环数据的方差分析。"

msgid "The data of the variable %1$s on level %2$s exceeds the tolerance for the concentration. The data shows almost zero variance. Did you maybe specify the wrong period?"
msgstr "水平 %2$s 上变量 %1$s 的数据超出了浓度的容差。数据显示方差几乎为零。您是否可能指定了错误的周期？"

msgid "The data of the variable %s exceeds the tolerance for the concentration. The data shows almost zero variance. Did you maybe specify the wrong period?"
msgstr "变量 %s 的数据超出了浓度的容差。数据显示方差几乎为零。您是否可能指定了错误的周期？"

msgid "Rao's spacing"
msgstr "Rao 间距"

msgid "Rayleigh"
msgstr "Rayleigh"

msgid "V against %s"
msgstr "V 对 %s"

msgid "Rao's Spacing"
msgstr "Rao 间距"

msgid "Estimated %s is infinite, could not compute results. Your data is too concentrated to calculate the assumption check."
msgstr "估计的 %s 为无穷大，无法计算结果。您的数据过于集中，无法计算假设检验。"

msgid "Uniformity Tests"
msgstr "均匀性检验"

msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

msgid "Level"
msgstr "水平"

msgid "Critical"
msgstr "临界值"

msgid "Statistic"
msgstr "统计量"

msgid "Gerald Russell and Daniel Levitin (2007). An Extended Table of Probability Values for Raos Spacing Test."
msgstr "Gerald Russell 与 Daniel Levitin（2007）。Rao 间距检验的概率值扩展表。"

msgid "The Rao spacing test was run with %1$s = %2$s, %3$s"
msgstr "Rao 间距检验以 %1$s = %2$s、%3$s 运行。"

msgid "Von Mises Assumption Check"
msgstr "Von Mises 假设检验"

msgid "Est. %s"
msgstr "估计 %s"

msgid "R. A. Lockhart and M. A. Stephens (1985). Tests of Fit for the Von Mises Distribution."
msgstr "R. A. Lockhart 与 M. A. Stephens（1985）。Von Mises 分布的拟合检验。"

msgid "Do not trust a significant result where %s is small (< 1). The data could rather be uniform."
msgstr "当 %s 较小（< 1）时，不要相信显著的结果。数据反而可能是均匀的。"

msgid "The test is run with %1$s = %2$s, so please compare the statistics to the critical value."
msgstr "该检验以 %1$s = %2$s 运行，请将统计量与临界值比较。"
